<section class="section section--white" id="consulting-services" aria-labelledby="s2-title">
  <div class="container">
    <header class="shead">
      <div class="shead__meta"></div>
      <div class="shead__body">
        <h2 class="shead__title rv" id="s2-title">Our Range of Cyber Security Consulting Services we provide</h2>
        <p class="shead__lede rv" style="--d:1">Our cyber security consulting services help businesses identify vulnerabilities, reduce cyber risks and protect critical digital assets through expert security assessments and practical recommendations.</p>
      </div>
    </header>

    <div class="ledger">
      <article class="ledger__cell rv">
        <div class="ledger__head">{{ icon("gauge") }}</div>
        <h3 class="ledger__title">Cyber Security Risk Assessment</h3>
        <p class="ledger__text">Identify security weaknesses across IT systems, applications and infrastructure. We evaluate potential threats and prioritize risks based on their severity and business impact.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="ledger__cell rv" style="--d:1">
        <div class="ledger__head">{{ icon("target") }}</div>
        <h3 class="ledger__title">Vulnerability Assessment &amp; Penetration Testing (VAPT)</h3>
        <p class="ledger__text">Discover vulnerabilities in websites, web applications, APIs, networks and IT infrastructure through security testing and authorized attempts to exploit identified weaknesses.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="ledger__cell rv" style="--d:2">
        <div class="ledger__head">{{ icon("cloud-lock") }}</div>
        <h3 class="ledger__title">Cloud Security Consulting</h3>
        <p class="ledger__text">Assess AWS, Microsoft Azure and Google Cloud environments to identify misconfigurations, excessive access permissions and data protection gaps.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="ledger__cell rv" style="--d:3">
        <div class="ledger__head">{{ icon("browser") }}</div>
        <h3 class="ledger__title">Application Security Consulting</h3>
        <p class="ledger__text">Review web applications, mobile apps and APIs to identify security flaws that could expose sensitive data or allow unauthorized access.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="ledger__cell rv">
        <div class="ledger__head">{{ icon("network") }}</div>
        <h3 class="ledger__title">Network Security Consulting</h3>
        <p class="ledger__text">Evaluate firewalls, network access controls, exposed services and network architecture to identify weaknesses and recommend stronger protection for business systems.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="ledger__cell rv" style="--d:1">
        <div class="ledger__head">{{ icon("clipboard") }}</div>
        <h3 class="ledger__title">Security Audit &amp; Compliance Consulting</h3>
        <p class="ledger__text">Review security controls and policies against applicable standards and regulatory requirements. Identify compliance gaps and recommend improvements to support audit preparation.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="ledger__cell rv" style="--d:2">
        <div class="ledger__head">{{ icon("route") }}</div>
        <h3 class="ledger__title">Cyber Security Strategy &amp; Roadmap</h3>
        <p class="ledger__text">Develop a prioritized security improvement plan based on business objectives, existing security controls, risk exposure and available resources.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="ledger__cell rv" style="--d:3">
        <div class="ledger__head">{{ icon("identity") }}</div>
        <h3 class="ledger__title">Identity &amp; Access Management Consulting</h3>
        <p class="ledger__text">Review user accounts, access permissions, authentication methods and privileged accounts to reduce unauthorized access and improve account security.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="ledger__cell rv">
        <div class="ledger__head">{{ icon("sliders") }}</div>
        <h3 class="ledger__title">Security Configuration &amp; Hardening</h3>
        <p class="ledger__text">Assess operating systems, servers, databases and cloud resources to identify insecure settings and recommend configuration changes that reduce security risks.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="ledger__cell rv" style="--d:1">
        <div class="ledger__head">{{ icon("alert") }}</div>
        <h3 class="ledger__title">Incident Response &amp; Preparedness Consulting</h3>
        <p class="ledger__text">Help businesses prepare for potential cyber incidents by reviewing response procedures, escalation processes and recovery plans. Identify gaps that could delay incident handling.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="ledger__cell rv" style="--d:2">
        <div class="ledger__head">{{ icon("eye") }}</div>
        <h3 class="ledger__title">Security Awareness &amp; Risk Advisory</h3>
        <p class="ledger__text">Help employees recognize phishing attempts, social engineering and unsafe digital practices through security awareness guidance and risk-focused recommendations.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="ledger__cell rv" style="--d:3">
        <div class="ledger__head">{{ icon("layers") }}</div>
        <h3 class="ledger__title">Security Architecture Review</h3>
        <p class="ledger__text">Review the design of applications, networks and cloud infrastructure to identify security gaps and recommend controls that support secure system development and deployment.</p>
      </article>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

