<section class="section section--stone" aria-labelledby="s4-title">
  <div class="container">
    <header class="shead">
      <div class="shead__meta"></div>
      <div class="shead__body">
        <h2 class="shead__title rv" id="s4-title">Strategic Cyber Security Consulting Across Critical Security Areas</h2>
        <p class="shead__lede rv" style="--d:1">Our cyber security consulting services cover key areas of security risk management, compliance and incident preparedness. From evaluating security maturity to reviewing third-party risks and strengthening incident response, we provide actionable recommendations that help organizations protect critical systems, improve security controls and make informed risk management decisions.</p>
      </div>
    </header>

    <div class="triggers">
      <div class="trigger rv">
        <span class="trigger__ico">{{ icon("radar", "lg") }}</span>
        <h3 class="trigger__title">Security Program Maturity</h3>
        <div class="trigger__text">
          <p>We assess your existing cybersecurity program across key security functions, including Identify, Protect, Detect, Respond and Recover. The assessment highlights capability gaps and evaluates your current security maturity against recognized frameworks such as the NIST Cybersecurity Framework (NIST CSF).</p>
          <p class="trigger__why"><strong>Key Output:</strong> Security maturity score, capability gap analysis and a prioritized roadmap for improving security practices.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="trigger rv">
        <span class="trigger__ico">{{ icon("gauge", "lg") }}</span>
        <h3 class="trigger__title">Risk Assessment &amp; Quantification</h3>
        <div class="trigger__text">
          <p>We identify and prioritize cybersecurity risks by evaluating critical assets, potential threats, existing controls and business impact. Risk quantification helps decision-makers understand exposure and allocate resources to the most significant security concerns.</p>
          <p class="trigger__why"><strong>Key Output:</strong> Cyber risk register, risk ratings, mitigation recommendations and quantitative estimates for high-priority risks.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="trigger rv">
        <span class="trigger__ico">{{ icon("badge", "lg") }}</span>
        <h3 class="trigger__title">Compliance Readiness</h3>
        <div class="trigger__text">
          <p>We evaluate security controls against relevant compliance frameworks and regulatory requirements, including ISO 27001, SOC 2, PCI DSS, HIPAA and GDPR, depending on your business and industry. The review identifies compliance gaps and recommends practical remediation steps.</p>
          <p class="trigger__why"><strong>Key Output:</strong> Compliance gap analysis, control assessment, remediation priorities and an implementation roadmap.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="trigger rv">
        <span class="trigger__ico">{{ icon("alert", "lg") }}</span>
        <h3 class="trigger__title">Incident Response Preparedness</h3>
        <div class="trigger__text">
          <p>We review your ability to detect, contain and recover from cybersecurity incidents such as ransomware attacks, data breaches and unauthorized access. Incident response plans and tabletop exercises help teams validate procedures, escalation paths and communication processes before an incident occurs.</p>
          <p class="trigger__why"><strong>Key Output:</strong> Updated incident response plans, scenario-specific playbooks, escalation procedures and post-exercise improvement recommendations.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="trigger rv">
        <span class="trigger__ico">{{ icon("link", "lg") }}</span>
        <h3 class="trigger__title">Vendor &amp; Supply Chain Risk</h3>
        <div class="trigger__text">
          <p>We assess third-party cybersecurity risks based on vendor access, data sensitivity and operational criticality. Reviews may include security questionnaires, control assessments, penetration testing reports and relevant assurance documents such as SOC 2 reports, depending on the vendor's risk level.</p>
          <p class="trigger__why"><strong>Key Output:</strong> Vendor risk register, security assessment questionnaire, risk-tier classification and prioritized third-party remediation actions.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="trigger rv">
        <span class="trigger__ico">{{ icon("doc-check", "lg") }}</span>
        <h3 class="trigger__title">Security Governance &amp; Policy</h3>
        <div class="trigger__text">
          <p>We review or develop cybersecurity policies, standards and procedures that define security responsibilities, access requirements, risk ownership and incident management practices. Governance recommendations align security activities with business objectives and applicable compliance obligations.</p>
          <p class="trigger__why"><strong>Key Output:</strong> Security policy framework, access control standards, responsibility matrix and cybersecurity governance roadmap.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

