<section class="section section--ink" aria-labelledby="s5-title">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="process">
      <div class="process__aside">
        <h2 class="process__title" id="s5-title">How Our Cyber Security Consulting Engagement Works</h2>
        <p class="process__lede">Our cyber security consulting services follow a structured engagement process that helps organizations identify security gaps, assess business risks and prioritize improvements based on their security requirements. Each stage focuses on actionable findings and practical recommendations that strengthen security controls while supporting business and compliance objectives.</p>
      </div>

      <ol class="process__list" data-process>
        <li class="step">
          <span class="step__marker" aria-hidden="true"></span>
          <h3 class="step__title">Discovery &amp; Scope Definition</h3>
          <p class="step__text">We understand your business environment, critical assets, existing security practices and engagement objectives. The scope is defined around your applications, cloud infrastructure, networks or compliance requirements.</p>
        </li>
        <li class="step">
          <span class="step__marker" aria-hidden="true"></span>
          <h3 class="step__title">Security Assessment &amp; Analysis</h3>
          <p class="step__text">We review security controls, configurations, policies and relevant technical evidence to identify vulnerabilities, control weaknesses and potential compliance gaps.</p>
        </li>
        <li class="step">
          <span class="step__marker" aria-hidden="true"></span>
          <h3 class="step__title">Risk Evaluation &amp; Prioritization</h3>
          <p class="step__text">We evaluate identified issues based on severity, exploitability and potential business impact. This helps your team distinguish critical risks from lower-priority findings and focus on the areas requiring immediate attention.</p>
        </li>
        <li class="step">
          <span class="step__marker" aria-hidden="true"></span>
          <h3 class="step__title">Recommendations &amp; Security Roadmap</h3>
          <p class="step__text">We provide practical recommendations to address security gaps and improve existing controls. Remediation activities are organized by urgency, implementation effort and business priorities.</p>
        </li>
        <li class="step">
          <span class="step__marker" aria-hidden="true"></span>
          <h3 class="step__title">Reporting &amp; Follow-Up Review</h3>
          <p class="step__text">We present the assessment results and explain the key findings to relevant stakeholders. Where included in the engagement scope, we review remediation evidence and reassess identified issues to track progress.</p>
        </li>
      </ol>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

